menu "Swipe"
config SWIPE_DIAGNOSTIC_CAPTURE
    bool "Legacy diagnostic build flag (no runtime effect)"
    default n
    help
        Retained for compatibility with existing build configurations.
        All builds now recognize continuously. A host HELLO command enables
        raw samples and actual gesture events; STOP disables telemetry only.
config SWIPE_CAPTURE_CHARGE_TIMES
    int "Charge/discharge cycles per measurement"
    range 50 2000
    default 200
    help
        Lower values increase scan rate but reduce count resolution.
        The recorder reports this setting and scales the hardware active
        threshold relative to the original 800-cycle configuration.
endmenu
